| name           = Hallowed Ground
| gameimage      = OberonHallowedGround.png
| cardimage      = HallowedGround.png
| hotkey         = 2
| energy         = 50
| description    = Sanctifies the ground before Oberon, inflicting Radiation Damage to all enemies within the radius. Also grants protection against Status Effects for Oberon and his allies.
| strength       = 25 / 50 / 75 / 100 ({{D|Radiation}} damage)
| duration       = 10 / 15 / 17 / 20 s
| range          = 8 / 10 / 12 / 15 m (radius)
| misc           = 100% ({{D|Radiation}} [[Status Chance]])<br>0.5 s (damage tick interval)<br>3 (Hallowed Ground cap)
|info = 
*{{WF|Oberon}} expends {{Stat|Ability Efficiency|icon=only}}'''50''' [[energy]] to consecrate the ground around him up to {{Stat|Ability Range|icon=only}}'''8 / 10 / 12 / 15''' meters, for {{Stat|Ability Duration|icon=only}}'''10 / 15 / 17 / 20''' seconds. Enemies standing on the area of effect are dealt {{Stat|Ability Strength|icon=only}}'''25 / 50 / 75 / 100''' {{D|Radiation}} damage with <u>'''100%'''</u> {{D|Radiation}} [[status chance]] every <u>'''0.5'''</u> seconds. Allies are cleansed and granted full [[Status Immunity]] for as long as they are standing in the area. 
**Up to a maximum of <u>'''3'''</u> Hallowed Grounds can exist at a time.
**Area of effect extends '''~2m''' above and below the casting surface.
**If cast in midair, Oberon will instantly drop to the ground to perform this ability.
**{{E|Nullifier Crewman}} will '''not''' destroy Hallowed Ground, but instead render enemies immune to its effects while inside the bubble.
*Hallowed Ground spawns foliage inside its area of effect as visual representation. Oberon creates a field of grass, while Oberon Prime creates a field of ferns. Grass and ferns are affected by Oberon's chosen Warframe Accent color.
**The shimmering energy field encompassing the ground is affected by Oberon's chosen Warframe energy color.
| synergies =
**{{A|Renewal}}'s {{Stat|Health}} restore per second is increased by <u>'''2x'''</u> when standing on Hallowed Ground.
**Hallowed Ground rapidly applies {{D|Radiation}} statuses to boost {{A|Reckoning}}'s damage.
|augment = 
